(6729601, 1007784, 37629, '<td valign="top">I wish the angle of the camera was little bit different. It would''ve been such a nice shot from dead on, the slight angle is pretty distracting unless it was because of the glare in the picture frames, which is still sort of there. I don''t know if this was intended to be serious or humorous, the girl looks super serious as the man makes me laugh as he is fooling around with his lighter. maybe she is mad at him for being too childish.It is also a bit bothersome that he is slightly out of focus. interesting shot.</td>', 'I wish the angle of the camera was little bit different. It would''ve been such a nice shot from dead on, the slight angle is pretty distracting unless it was because of the glare in the picture frames, which is still sort of there. I don''t know if this was intended to be serious or humorous, the girl looks super serious as the man makes me laugh as he is fooling around with his lighter. maybe she is mad at him for being too childish.It is also a bit bothersome that he is slightly out of focus. interesting shot.', '2012-04-02 12:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6729602, 1007757, 37629, '<td valign="top">hah, I enjoy this. What a bummer. I''m thinking it will do well in the challenge. Nice use of whitespace. It might''ve been nicer if the situation allowed for you to keep the whole chair in and not just crop off an arm of it. Or to compensate I would have cropped out a bit of the clock for visual symmetry. Not a bad pic!</td>', 'hah, I enjoy this. What a bummer. I''m thinking it will do well in the challenge. Nice use of whitespace. It might''ve been nicer if the situation allowed for you to keep the whole chair in and not just crop off an arm of it. Or to compensate I would have cropped out a bit of the clock for visual symmetry. Not a bad pic!', '2012-04-02 12:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6729603, 1007848, 37629, '<td valign="top">The branches in the back are a bit distracting but the frame of the branches in the foreground is pretty phenomenal. Lovely subject as well and as for the background, well it''s nature, what can you do right? nice pic.</td>', 'The branches in the back are a bit distracting but the frame of the branches in the foreground is pretty phenomenal. Lovely subject as well and as for the background, well it''s nature, what can you do right? nice pic.', '2012-04-02 12:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6729605, 1007740, 37629, '<td valign="top">I absolutely have a fondness for staring at an image of a cluttered studio. the bulb in the bottom left hand corner seems a bit harshly lit but it likely works to keep it visible and it''s a nice indicator to start looking for the bulbs in the corners. Neat.</td>', 'I absolutely have a fondness for staring at an image of a cluttered studio. the bulb in the bottom left hand corner seems a bit harshly lit but it likely works to keep it visible and it''s a nice indicator to start looking for the bulbs in the corners. Neat.', '2012-04-02 12:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6729606, 1007571, 37629, '<td valign="top">Wowww, I really enjoy this entry. the figure emerging from the darkness. cool capture.</td>', 'Wowww, I really enjoy this entry. the figure emerging from the darkness. cool capture.', '2012-04-02 12:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6729607, 1007248, 37629, '<td valign="top">the composition, tones, lighting execution and the way the railing divides the photo are excellent. very well done.</td>', 'the composition, tones, lighting execution and the way the railing divides the photo are excellent. very well done.', '2012-04-02 12:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6729609, 1007339, 37629, '<td valign="top">Easily one of my favourite shots of the challenge so far. Only thing I HATE is that little red line along the edge of the border, it''s a bit distracting and very unnecessary, the shot is fantastic on its own. It''s like they are climbing huge bedsheets. The only other minor pet peeve I have is the uneven distance from the people to the edge of the image. the way that line of the hill cuts diagonally through the image is fantastic though. again, I love this, very nice.</td>', 'Easily one of my favourite shots of the challenge so far. Only thing I HATE is that little red line along the edge of the border, it''s a bit distracting and very unnecessary, the shot is fantastic on its own. It''s like they are climbing huge bedsheets. The only other minor pet peeve I have is the uneven distance from the people to the edge of the image. the way that line of the hill cuts diagonally through the image is fantastic though. again, I love this, very nice.', '2012-04-02 12:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6729611, 1006906, 37629, '<td valign="top">If this wasn''t staged, this is an awesome photo and meets the challenge so well. It isn''t the kind of thing people on this site usually vote for but man, what a lucky shot, I love it a lot. well done.</td>', 'If this wasn''t staged, this is an awesome photo and meets the challenge so well. It isn''t the kind of thing people on this site usually vote for but man, what a lucky shot, I love it a lot. well done.', '2012-04-02 12:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6729616, 1007771, 37629, '<td valign="top">I had to stare at this image for a few minutes at least and I still don''t know what exactly I''m looking at. Interestingly edited and the little ladder thing is cool, I sometimes like mystery narratives but this feels too staged for that. I really do need to stay tuned for the next episode, unless i''m being a dolt and really missing the point here.</td>', 'I had to stare at this image for a few minutes at least and I still don''t know what exactly I''m looking at. Interestingly edited and the little ladder thing is cool, I sometimes like mystery narratives but this feels too staged for that. I really do need to stay tuned for the next episode, unless i''m being a dolt and really missing the point here.', '2012-04-02 12:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6729620, 1007717, 37629, '<td valign="top">This would have been a nice shot but MAN that frame. Ughhhh. it''s soooo bad. I''ll try to cover it with my hands and vote based on that.</td>', 'This would have been a nice shot but MAN that frame. Ughhhh. it''s soooo bad. I''ll try to cover it with my hands and vote based on that.', '2012-04-02 12:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
