(6736031, 1007570, 50864, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tones and textures. One of my favorites.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-04-09 00:14:26.</i></td>', 'Beautiful tones and textures. One of my favorites.', '2012-04-08 12:02:35.000000', '2012-04-09 01:14:26.000000', 1),
(6736169, 1007775, 30982, '<td valign="top">An excellent photo to begin with, then you add the dog which is priceless, and the loner, even better; then top it off with the title, which is a great song. AND it is perfect for the challenge!  Only the third picture I''ve voted but so far it is the best in show for me.</td>', 'An excellent photo to begin with, then you add the dog which is priceless, and the loner, even better; then top it off with the title, which is a great song. AND it is perfect for the challenge!  Only the third picture I''ve voted but so far it is the best in show for me.', '2012-04-08 14:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6736170, 1007784, 30982, '<td valign="top">Charming!  Including the photographer in the reflection.  A wee taste of "staged" but it''s delightful enough to overcome that.</td>', 'Charming!  Including the photographer in the reflection.  A wee taste of "staged" but it''s delightful enough to overcome that.', '2012-04-08 14:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6736211, 1007784, 61396, '<td valign="top">great little story (even if staged)</td>', 'great little story (even if staged)', '2012-04-08 15:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6736244, 1007232, 61396, '<td valign="top">almost missed those legs; glad that I didn''t, as it gives me something real to relate to in addition to the gloomy surroundings reflected in the puddle.</td>', 'almost missed those legs; glad that I didn''t, as it gives me something real to relate to in addition to the gloomy surroundings reflected in the puddle.', '2012-04-08 15:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6736252, 1007775, 61396, '<td valign="top">What a moment! We are forced to try and get into that young man head as he views the scene himself. Those other choices you made elevate this for me even higher: the yellow cast (maybe to eliminate the sea?) making it look like you used an expired film; that you chopped man and animal equally (I even like that redundantly looking small bird turning her back to the happening).</td>', 'What a moment! We are forced to try and get into that young man head as he views the scene himself. Those other choices you made elevate this for me even higher: the yellow cast (maybe to eliminate the sea?) making it look like you used an expired film; that you chopped man and animal equally (I even like that redundantly looking small bird turning her back to the happening).', '2012-04-08 16:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6736270, 1007867, 143116, '<td valign="top">Good catch on the monkey''s look, but a little more separation of the fence and background would have strengthened your image</td>', 'Good catch on the monkey''s look, but a little more separation of the fence and background would have strengthened your image', '2012-04-08 17:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6736272, 1007710, 143116, '<td valign="top">I like the way you framed this, although I think I would have preferred this in color, which would better match your title.</td>', 'I like the way you framed this, although I think I would have preferred this in color, which would better match your title.', '2012-04-08 17:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6736273, 1006964, 143116, '<td valign="top">Nice in its simplicity. Lighting nicely done (but what''s the green shade on the faucets?). I think you would have been closer to the challenge by cropping of the lower 20% of you image.</td>', 'Nice in its simplicity. Lighting nicely done (but what''s the green shade on the faucets?). I think you would have been closer to the challenge by cropping of the lower 20% of you image.', '2012-04-08 17:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
