(6736644, 1007771, 115307, '<td valign="top">So rollover is in an hour, and I still have no idea how to vote this image. I have long since voted on all others and just can''t decide for this one.<br/>I am just torn because I think it is a beautifully taken photograph, but for me it is DNMC. While there are aspects that reside in the corner, the main point of interest clearly is not. Very torn on what kind of score I should give. Do I reward the merits of the photograph, even if part of the reason this photograph is so good is because it follows general composition rules rather than staying in the corners? I just don''t know</td>', 'So rollover is in an hour, and I still have no idea how to vote this image. I have long since voted on all others and just can''t decide for this one.I am just torn because I think it is a beautifully taken photograph, but for me it is DNMC. While there are aspects that reside in the corner, the main point of interest clearly is not. Very torn on what kind of score I should give. Do I reward the merits of the photograph, even if part of the reason this photograph is so good is because it follows general composition rules rather than staying in the corners? I just don''t know', '2012-04-08 23:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
