(6736747, 1007570, 124815, '<td valign="top">Surprise, surprise! Every so often the planets get into a certain configuration, the people become more <u><strike>reeptive</strike></u> receptive, the eyes sharper, the hearts nobler ....<br/>You shall share the award with your models or give them a bonus of sorts. The wall is a work of art that only time can achieve. <br/>You wore a blue ribbon in my book before the turnover. It''s still blue.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-04-09 00:17:06.</i></td>', 'Surprise, surprise! Every so often the planets get into a certain configuration, the people become more reeptive receptive, the eyes sharper, the hearts nobler ....You shall share the award with your models or give them a bonus of sorts. The wall is a work of art that only time can achieve. You wore a blue ribbon in my book before the turnover. It''s still blue.', '2012-04-09 01:14:34.000000', '2012-04-09 01:17:06.000000', 0),
