(6737025, 1007736, 103142, '<td valign="top">I truly love this shot, and I love that you kept the whole scene in. Cropping it in to make the fisherman stand out more would ruin the whole shot. It''s the juxtaposition of the peace and solitude of the fishing and the grunge and pollution of the factory. What a great find and what a wonderful shot!</td>', 'I truly love this shot, and I love that you kept the whole scene in. Cropping it in to make the fisherman stand out more would ruin the whole shot. It''s the juxtaposition of the peace and solitude of the fishing and the grunge and pollution of the factory. What a great find and what a wonderful shot!', '2012-04-09 10:46:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(6737029, 1007570, 138630, '<td valign="top">Endearing capture and I love the composition - post and cornered subjects and scratched up negative space and black and white and all.  Congratulations on the ribbon.</td>', 'Endearing capture and I love the composition - post and cornered subjects and scratched up negative space and black and white and all.  Congratulations on the ribbon.', '2012-04-09 10:52:18.000000', NULL, 0),
