(6737053, 1007772, 96664, '<td valign="top">For the sake of trying to find something wrong with this for critique purposes... I just don''t think that it is quite sharp enough on the eyes. For portraits, it''s all about how sharp you can get the eyes without overdoing in post process. The background is blown out nicely but I just don''t think that the viewers eyes went to anything in specific. That specific needed to be the eyes and it''s just not there for me.</td>', 'For the sake of trying to find something wrong with this for critique purposes... I just don''t think that it is quite sharp enough on the eyes. For portraits, it''s all about how sharp you can get the eyes without overdoing in post process. The background is blown out nicely but I just don''t think that the viewers eyes went to anything in specific. That specific needed to be the eyes and it''s just not there for me.', '2012-04-09 11:18:33.000000', NULL, 0),
