(6737189, 1007570, 60862, '<td valign="top">Congrats, Don!  Just straight congrats, no sadness. I don''t think your point all these years has been to disdain ribbons, but rather to hope (and help!) people recognize something other than the typical as ribbon-worthy.  And you stayed true to your vision as you did it.<br/> <br/>So for ribboning while doing all that, congrats!</td>', 'Congrats, Don!  Just straight congrats, no sadness. I don''t think your point all these years has been to disdain ribbons, but rather to hope (and help!) people recognize something other than the typical as ribbon-worthy.  And you stayed true to your vision as you did it. So for ribboning while doing all that, congrats!', '2012-04-09 13:12:08.000000', NULL, 0),
