(6739757, 1007220, 86447, '<td valign="top">A bit of noise in the sky for my monitor... but I love the corner placement.   The colors don''t bother me... They, with the vignette, make it an "old fashioned" image.</td>', 'A bit of noise in the sky for my monitor... but I love the corner placement.   The colors don''t bother me... They, with the vignette, make it an "old fashioned" image.', '2012-04-12 18:37:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(6739961, 1007757, 146356, '<td valign="top">I am glad that kid is not mine, cause god knows she''d get away with murder lol. The image draws out a beautiful response. She acts well for any age.<br/> <br/>Best, <br/> <br/>Devinder</td>', 'I am glad that kid is not mine, cause god knows she''d get away with murder lol. The image draws out a beautiful response. She acts well for any age. Best,  Devinder', '2012-04-12 22:35:08.000000', NULL, 0),
