(6741422, 1007339, 112972, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by nicktv:</b></div><hr/><i> Amazing, how did you get that shot - from a helicopter or higher mount? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Just a higher platform.  Here is a random image I found by somebody on flickr which should give you a better idea on where I was standing while taking this picture:<br/> <br/><a href="//www.flickr.com/photos/79286287@N00/3998387340/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.flickr.com/photos/79286287@N00/3998387340/</a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-03-26 23:44:07.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by nicktv: Amazing, how did you get that shot - from a helicopter or higher mount?   Just a higher platform.  Here is a random image I found by somebody on flickr which should give you a better idea on where I was standing while taking this picture: //www.flickr.com/photos/79286287@N00/3998387340/', '2012-04-14 13:33:10.000000', '2013-03-26 23:44:07.000000', 0),
